WEBVTT

00:05:59.636 --> 00:06:01.996
and create a big pile of waste,

00:06:02.036 --> 00:06:05.396
we believe we can
retrofit existing vessels

00:06:05.396 --> 00:06:09.396
by adding a combustion engine
designed for green fuel,

00:06:09.876 --> 00:06:13.516
and with that,
achieve zero-carbon shipping

00:06:13.556 --> 00:06:15.556
much, much earlier.

00:06:17.036 --> 00:06:23.756
(Applause)

00:06:23.756 --> 00:06:27.516
On top of that, power-to-X
is actually a very nice solution

00:06:27.516 --> 00:06:30.756
for one of the biggest problems
in renewable energy systems: